You are a senior full-stack engineer. Build a production-ready Typing Tutor SaaS web application called "TypeMaster".

The application must be scalable, secure, maintainable, and ready for deployment.

================================================
TECH STACK
================================================

Frontend:
- Next.js 16 App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui
- React Hook Form
- Zod validation
- TanStack Query
- Zustand for client state
- Recharts for analytics
- Framer Motion animations

Backend:
- NestJS
- TypeScript
- PostgreSQL
- TypeORM
- Redis caching
- JWT authentication
- Swagger API documentation

Infrastructure:
- Docker
- Nginx reverse proxy
- CI/CD pipeline
- Environment based configuration


================================================
SYSTEM MODULES
================================================

Create these modules:


AUTH MODULE

Features:
- Register
- Login
- Logout
- Refresh token
- Forgot password
- Reset password
- Email verification

Roles:

USER
ADMIN


Security:
- Password hashing using bcrypt
- JWT access token
- Refresh token rotation
- Rate limiting
- Input validation


================================================
USER MODULE
================================================

Entity:

User

Fields:

id
username
email
passwordHash
avatar
role
level
experiencePoints
targetWpm
dailyGoal
createdAt
updatedAt


Features:

- Profile management
- Learning preferences
- Statistics summary


================================================
TYPING ENGINE MODULE
================================================

This is the core feature.


Support:

1. Practice Mode

Types:

- Words
- Sentences
- Paragraph
- Code


2. Test Mode

Duration:

15 seconds
30 seconds
60 seconds
300 seconds


Real-time calculation:


WPM:

(words typed / minutes)


Accuracy:

(correct characters / total characters) * 100


Track:

- Correct characters
- Wrong characters
- Backspaces
- Completion time


Store every session.


================================================
LESSON MODULE
================================================

Entity:


Lesson

Fields:

id
title
description
level
category
content
order
duration


Categories:

BEGINNER

- Home row keys
- Top row keys
- Bottom row keys
- Numbers


INTERMEDIATE

- Common words
- Sentences
- Speed practice


ADVANCED

- Long paragraphs
- Programming


================================================
PRACTICE HISTORY MODULE
================================================


Entity:

TypingSession


Fields:

id
userId
lessonId
mode
duration
wpm
accuracy
errors
charactersTyped
createdAt



Provide APIs:


GET
/users/me/history


GET
/users/me/statistics



================================================
ACHIEVEMENT MODULE
================================================


Create achievement system.


Examples:

FIRST_30_WPM

FIRST_1000_WORDS

SEVEN_DAY_STREAK

ACCURACY_MASTER



Entities:


Achievement

UserAchievement


================================================
LEADERBOARD MODULE
================================================


Support:

- Global ranking
- Weekly ranking
- Monthly ranking
- Friends ranking



Ranking based on:

- Highest WPM
- Accuracy
- Total practice


================================================
ANALYTICS MODULE
================================================


Generate:

- WPM trend
- Accuracy trend
- Practice time
- Daily streak
- Weak keys analysis



================================================
ADMIN PANEL
================================================


Admin features:

Dashboard:

- Total users
- Active users
- Practice sessions
- Average WPM


Management:

- User management
- Lesson management
- Achievement management


